WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.513 --> 00:00:02.547
&gt;&gt;&gt; Good morning, everyone.

00:00:02.681 --> 00:00:05.784
We're glad you're with us.

00:00:05.917 --> 00:00:08.487
I'm poppy Harlow alongside

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:09.654
Victor Blackwell.

00:00:10.088 --> 00:00:11.757
A dramatic turn of events for

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:13.625
the mercy their leader accused

00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:18.797
of launching a real about an I

00:00:19.164 --> 00:00:19.798
don't know rebellion.

00:00:19.931 --> 00:00:21.900
Yevgeny prigozhin is back in

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:23.869
Russia instead of being in exile

00:00:24.002 --> 00:00:25.370
in Belarus.

00:00:25.504 --> 00:00:27.172
&gt;&gt; This is as state media

00:00:27.172 --> 00:00:28.640
reports that they raided

00:00:28.774 --> 00:00:31.243
prigozhin's properties in St.

00:00:31.376 --> 00:00:32.110
Petersburg.

00:00:32.244 --> 00:00:33.745
The Russian government had

00:00:33.879 --> 00:00:35.447
claimed that it was dropping

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:36.481
charges against him.

00:00:36.615 --> 00:00:37.949
And they say they uncovered

00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:41.186
stashes of gold, money, wigs and

00:00:41.253 --> 00:00:43.722
guns and passports allegedly

00:00:43.855 --> 00:00:45.223
belonging to the mercenary

00:00:45.357 --> 00:00:45.557
leader.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:46.758
We have team coverage from

00:00:47.192 --> 00:00:48.160
Washington to Belarus.

00:00:48.293 --> 00:00:50.028
Let's start with Matthew chance

00:00:50.162 --> 00:00:50.629
in Minsk.

00:00:50.762 --> 00:00:51.863
You spoke with the president and

00:00:51.997 --> 00:00:53.365
you got an answer to the

00:00:53.498 --> 00:00:57.202
question that everyone has been

00:00:57.302 --> 00:00:59.304
wondering about the whereabouts

00:00:59.438 --> 00:01:00.005
of prigozhin.

00:01:00.138 --> 00:01:01.440
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Yeah, and we were

00:01:01.573 --> 00:01:05.210
all absolutely shocked by the

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:09.381
answer of the leader of Belarus,

00:01:09.514 --> 00:01:09.948
Alexander lukashenko.

00:01:10.081 --> 00:01:11.316
I'm at the palace of

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:13.218
Independence which is one of

00:01:13.218 --> 00:01:14.152
lukashenko's main offices in the

00:01:14.286 --> 00:01:15.220
center of Minsk.

00:01:15.253 --> 00:01:17.222
And he called a few members of

00:01:17.222 --> 00:01:19.224
the international press around

00:01:19.357 --> 00:01:21.460
to hold what he said was a

00:01:21.593 --> 00:01:22.694
conversation about the events

00:01:22.828 --> 00:01:24.162
that have been unfolding over

00:01:24.296 --> 00:01:27.232
the course of the past couple

00:01:27.232 --> 00:01:27.866
weeks or so.

00:01:27.999 --> 00:01:29.234
And I asked him specifically

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:30.635
what could he tell us about

00:01:30.769 --> 00:01:32.471
Wagner, about the mercenary

00:01:32.604 --> 00:01:34.172
Russian group, and about its

00:01:34.306 --> 00:01:35.907
leader yevgeny prigozhin who he

00:01:36.041 --> 00:01:39.511
had offered exile in Belarus in

00:01:39.644 --> 00:01:40.378
exchange for them calling off

00:01:40.512 --> 00:01:44.149
the armed rebellion that they

00:01:44.282 --> 00:01:45.951
staged in Russia last week.

00:01:46.084 --> 00:01:48.153
Take a listen to what lukashenko

00:01:48.286 --> 00:01:49.254
had to say.

00:01:49.254 --> 00:01:51.256
&gt;&gt; I wonder if you could provide

00:01:51.256 --> 00:02:01.766
us all with a bit of an updathereabouts leader

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:02.267
yevgeny prigozhin.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.635
Is he in Belarus?

00:02:03.768 --> 00:02:04.669
&gt;&gt; Translator: In terms of

00:02:04.803 --> 00:02:07.272
yevgeny prigozhin, is he in St.

00:02:07.272 --> 00:02:07.405
Petersburg.

00:02:07.539 --> 00:02:08.440
Or maybe this morning he would

00:02:08.573 --> 00:02:10.175
travel to Moscow or elsewhere.

00:02:10.308 --> 00:02:11.743
But he is not on the territory

00:02:11.877 --> 00:02:16.081
of Belarus now.

00:02:16.214 --> 00:02:16.715
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Not on the

00:02:16.848 --> 00:02:18.483
territory of Belarus, which is

00:02:18.617 --> 00:02:20.685
something that we did not know

00:02:20.819 --> 00:02:21.286
before this morning.

00:02:21.353 --> 00:02:23.555
Also I asked him about whether

00:02:23.688 --> 00:02:25.624
Wagner forces, the fighters of

00:02:25.757 --> 00:02:27.325
Wagner, had taken up his offer

00:02:27.459 --> 00:02:29.461
and relocated to Belarus as

00:02:29.594 --> 00:02:29.761
well.

00:02:29.895 --> 00:02:32.864
That was also part of the deal

00:02:33.298 --> 00:02:34.099
that lukashenko offered.

00:02:34.232 --> 00:02:35.700
And he said as yet no Wagner

00:02:35.834 --> 00:02:37.302
fighters have come to Belarus

00:02:37.302 --> 00:02:38.570
and he is not at the moment

00:02:38.703 --> 00:02:41.740
preparing any facilities to

00:02:41.873 --> 00:02:42.340
house them.

00:02:42.474 --> 00:02:45.477
So it all hints at the idea that

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:46.545
this deal that was brokered to

00:02:46.678 --> 00:02:48.547
bring to an end the military

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:51.883
uprising in Russia last week is

00:02:52.017 --> 00:02:53.518
being reviewed, programs the

00:02:53.652 --> 00:02:55.453
Kremlin is reviewing it, and

00:02:55.587 --> 00:02:57.989
that is backed up by the fact

00:02:58.123 --> 00:03:00.091
Russian TV has new video of a

00:03:00.225 --> 00:03:02.561
police raid in St. Petersburg,

00:03:02.694 --> 00:03:04.529
the Russian city of yevgeny

00:03:04.663 --> 00:03:05.964
prigozhin's house, and they

00:03:06.097 --> 00:03:07.532
found extraordinary things

00:03:07.666 --> 00:03:09.334
there.

00:03:09.334 --> 00:03:12.170
Weapons, cash, gold, passports,

00:03:12.304 --> 00:03:13.471
some of which said to have

00:03:13.605 --> 00:03:16.875
multiple identities of yevgeny

00:03:17.008 --> 00:03:19.344
prigozhin and wig as well

00:03:19.344 --> 00:03:20.545
presumably for disguise.

00:03:20.679 --> 00:03:21.713
And it is all really

00:03:21.846 --> 00:03:23.582
discrediting the Wagner leader.

00:03:23.715 --> 00:03:26.084
And it does imply that there may

00:03:26.217 --> 00:03:27.552
be some kind of move against him

00:03:27.686 --> 00:03:30.855
by the Russian authorities.

00:03:30.989 --> 00:03:32.624
I've asked the Kremlin to

00:03:32.757 --> 00:03:34.092
comment, and when they get back

00:03:34.225 --> 00:03:35.727
to me, I'll let you know.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:39.364
&gt;&gt; On that point in that

00:03:39.464 --> 00:03:41.666
conversation, you and others had

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.668
with lukashenko, he was asked

00:03:43.802 --> 00:03:45.637
what happens to Putin next and

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.372
he essentially said -- what

00:03:47.472 --> 00:03:49.040
happens to prigozhin next and he

00:03:49.374 --> 00:03:49.708
essentially said everything

00:03:49.841 --> 00:03:50.508
happens in life.

00:03:50.642 --> 00:03:53.011
But then seemed to say don't

00:03:53.378 --> 00:03:54.312
worry, Putin won't be dumb

00:03:54.446 --> 00:04:01.386
enough to have him killed.

00:04:01.386 --> 00:04:03.622
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Yes, look, he was

00:04:03.755 --> 00:04:06.257
pretty noncommittal about what

00:04:06.391 --> 00:04:06.992
happens to prigozhin.

00:04:07.392 --> 00:04:08.827
And he said a number of times

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:11.997
that he wasn't able to read the

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:12.697
future, et cetera, et cetera.

00:04:12.831 --> 00:04:13.898
But he said look, he does not

00:04:14.032 --> 00:04:18.169
think that Putin at this point

00:04:18.303 --> 00:04:20.405
would kill yevgeny prigozhin.

00:04:20.538 --> 00:04:21.473
But the fact that he even

00:04:21.606 --> 00:04:23.408
mentioned that as a possibility

00:04:23.408 --> 00:04:24.643
I think led us all to sort of

00:04:24.776 --> 00:04:26.611
like sit back and sort of take

00:04:26.745 --> 00:04:30.015
stock of the seriousness of the

00:04:30.148 --> 00:04:31.583
situation that the Wagner leader

00:04:31.716 --> 00:04:36.021
is now in.

00:04:36.154 --> 00:04:37.589
You have lukashenko talking

00:04:37.722 --> 00:04:38.623
about the possibility, playing

00:04:38.757 --> 00:04:40.425
it down, yes, but talking about

00:04:40.558 --> 00:04:42.260
the possibility of him being

00:04:42.394 --> 00:04:45.430
killed by Putin.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:46.398
So clearly the indications are

00:04:46.531 --> 00:04:48.967
that there are moves afoot first

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.602
of all to discredit the Wagner

00:04:50.735 --> 00:04:52.203
leader possibly in the future to

00:04:52.337 --> 00:04:53.438
take action against him.

00:04:53.438 --> 00:04:55.440
But who knows what.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.442
&gt;&gt; Matthew, stay with us.

00:04:57.442 --> 00:05:01.012
Let's bring in former Moscow

00:05:01.446 --> 00:05:04.249
bureau chief Jill Dougherty and

00:05:04.382 --> 00:05:05.750
also analyst from the "New York

00:05:05.884 --> 00:05:07.052
Times" David Sanger.

00:05:07.452 --> 00:05:10.221
Jill, let me start with you.

00:05:10.355 --> 00:05:11.456
The deal in many respects to

00:05:11.556 --> 00:05:13.858
save prigozhin's life was that

00:05:13.992 --> 00:05:21.466
he would then goif in exile to

00:05:21.566 --> 00:05:21.766
Belarus.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:26.504
Now that prigozhin is in St.

00:05:26.638 --> 00:05:27.605
Petersburg, was there is a deal,

00:05:27.739 --> 00:05:29.474
is he going to be prosecuted

00:05:29.541 --> 00:05:30.575
after this raid?

00:05:30.709 --> 00:05:33.545
What is your read on this news?

00:05:33.678 --> 00:05:36.581
&gt;&gt; It is priceless actually.

00:05:36.715 --> 00:05:39.484
We knew about a week ago when

00:05:39.484 --> 00:05:42.353
Putin said by the way, the

00:05:42.487 --> 00:05:43.822
Russian government has given

00:05:43.955 --> 00:05:46.324
prigozhin roughly $2 billion and

00:05:46.458 --> 00:05:48.093
we hope not too much was taken,

00:05:48.226 --> 00:05:51.496
or kind of an indication, we

00:05:51.496 --> 00:05:52.764
knew at that point that the

00:05:52.897 --> 00:05:56.367
other shoe could definitely

00:05:56.501 --> 00:05:56.668
drop.

00:05:56.801 --> 00:05:58.136
And that prigozhin could not

00:05:58.269 --> 00:05:59.504
necessarily be killed but he

00:05:59.504 --> 00:06:01.706
could be prosecuted for

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:02.107
corruption.

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:05.610
And I think that the play is

00:06:05.744 --> 00:06:07.011
working out exactly like that.

00:06:07.145 --> 00:06:11.516
This deal is essentially Putin's

00:06:11.583 --> 00:06:12.650
deal with lukashenko playing

00:06:12.784 --> 00:06:15.954
role of trying to help Putin by

00:06:16.087 --> 00:06:17.188
creating this deal, it doesn't

00:06:17.522 --> 00:06:19.591
work, and maybe it was never

00:06:19.724 --> 00:06:20.959
supposed to work.

00:06:21.092 --> 00:06:23.528
So if prigozhin now is on state

00:06:23.528 --> 00:06:25.530
television or his department is

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.899
with money and wigs, et cetera,

00:06:28.032 --> 00:06:29.534
just an example of the

00:06:29.534 --> 00:06:30.535
government now Putin's

00:06:30.668 --> 00:06:32.771
government coming up with the

00:06:32.904 --> 00:06:36.374
proof that prigozhin should be

00:06:36.508 --> 00:06:36.775
prosecuted.

00:06:36.908 --> 00:06:37.709
That prigozhin was too dangerous

00:06:37.842 --> 00:06:41.546
for Putin to allow to continue

00:06:41.546 --> 00:06:42.347
to exist wherever he was.

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.716
&gt;&gt; David, do you think president

00:06:44.849 --> 00:06:51.556
lukashenko is telling the truth?

00:06:51.556 --> 00:06:53.558
&gt;&gt; Shockingly we have been

00:06:53.591 --> 00:06:54.659
misled here.

00:06:54.793 --> 00:06:57.562
It was president lukashenko who

00:06:57.629 --> 00:06:59.564
in late June said that prigozhin

00:06:59.564 --> 00:07:02.267
was in Belarus.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.102
U.S. And Ukrainian intelligence

00:07:04.235 --> 00:07:05.570
has said since they don't

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.572
believe he ever stepped foot in

00:07:07.572 --> 00:07:08.640
Belarus and as we all discussed

00:07:08.773 --> 00:07:11.576
on this show a week ago, being

00:07:11.709 --> 00:07:14.078
in Belarus wouldn't offer him

00:07:14.212 --> 00:07:19.184
any protection from being

00:07:19.584 --> 00:07:23.021
assassinated, attacked from

00:07:23.154 --> 00:07:23.588
Moscow.

00:07:23.588 --> 00:07:26.224
So that is the first thought.

00:07:26.357 --> 00:07:27.592
Second is that we actually think

00:07:27.725 --> 00:07:31.896
that along the way prigozhin

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:34.098
here has proven himself to be

00:07:34.232 --> 00:07:36.367
too valuable in many ways to

00:07:36.501 --> 00:07:39.103
kill as lukashenko suggested,

00:07:39.237 --> 00:07:41.206
that you don't know how his

00:07:41.606 --> 00:07:43.007
troops would react and others.

00:07:43.141 --> 00:07:44.175
So instead what you are seeing

00:07:44.309 --> 00:07:46.945
is that the Russians are

00:07:47.078 --> 00:07:49.681
systemically dismantlings Wagner

00:07:49.814 --> 00:07:50.615
group, they have been moving

00:07:50.748 --> 00:07:52.984
some of the assets to other

00:07:53.117 --> 00:07:55.620
companies friendlier to Putin

00:07:55.687 --> 00:07:59.190
himself, some are reportedly

00:07:59.624 --> 00:08:02.160
going to the former gymnast who

00:08:02.293 --> 00:08:04.696
U.S. Intelligence suggest is the

00:08:04.829 --> 00:08:08.600
mother of several of Putin's

00:08:08.733 --> 00:08:08.967
children.

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.435
But she also runs something

00:08:10.568 --> 00:08:11.870
called the national media group.

00:08:12.003 --> 00:08:13.705
So you are seeing Wagner being

00:08:13.838 --> 00:08:16.541
folded back into government hold

00:08:16.674 --> 00:08:20.678
which of course is exactly what

00:08:20.812 --> 00:08:21.779
started this to begin with.

00:08:21.913 --> 00:08:23.648
&gt;&gt; Matthew, back to you.

00:08:23.648 --> 00:08:25.650
Is there any evidence, any

00:08:25.717 --> 00:08:28.753
indication even from president

00:08:28.887 --> 00:08:29.654
lukashenko that prigozhin was

00:08:29.654 --> 00:08:32.290
ever in Belarus, does he even

00:08:32.423 --> 00:08:34.926
make that claim?

00:08:35.059 --> 00:08:37.028
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Well, beyond the

00:08:37.161 --> 00:08:38.563
facts as David said that he said

00:08:38.696 --> 00:08:42.600
it a week or so ago that

00:08:42.734 --> 00:08:43.768
prigozhin was in the country,

00:08:43.902 --> 00:08:45.703
no, there has been no supporting

00:08:45.837 --> 00:08:46.070
evidence.

00:08:46.204 --> 00:08:47.672
We haven't managed to verify it.

00:08:47.739 --> 00:08:48.840
But the fact that he's

00:08:48.973 --> 00:08:50.608
backtracked now is quite

00:08:50.742 --> 00:08:52.343
astonishing.

00:08:52.477 --> 00:08:53.044
But he does make a lot more

00:08:53.177 --> 00:08:53.344
sense.

00:08:53.678 --> 00:08:54.245
Because one of the most

00:08:54.379 --> 00:08:57.081
incredible unbelievable things

00:08:57.215 --> 00:08:59.684
about the way this whole

00:08:59.751 --> 00:09:03.221
military up rising ended in

00:09:03.354 --> 00:09:04.389
Russia a week or so ago, was

00:09:04.522 --> 00:09:06.257
that yevgeny prigozhin who

00:09:06.391 --> 00:09:07.692
effectively led an uprising

00:09:07.692 --> 00:09:09.160
against the Kremlin was just

00:09:09.294 --> 00:09:11.930
allowed to walk away into what

00:09:12.063 --> 00:09:13.698
would have been a relatively

00:09:13.698 --> 00:09:14.599
comfortable exile as we

00:09:14.732 --> 00:09:16.901
understood it in Belarus.

00:09:17.035 --> 00:09:19.103
That just felt, you know,

00:09:19.237 --> 00:09:20.438
unrealistic given what we know

00:09:20.571 --> 00:09:22.807
about what happens to people who

00:09:22.941 --> 00:09:23.274
cross Putin.

00:09:23.708 --> 00:09:25.710
They fall out of windows, they

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.879
get poisoned, they get

00:09:28.012 --> 00:09:29.147
imprisoned, something negative

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:29.714
happens.

00:09:29.714 --> 00:09:31.015
They don't just walk away from

00:09:31.149 --> 00:09:31.316
this.

00:09:31.716 --> 00:09:34.986
And Putin was absolutely furious

00:09:35.119 --> 00:09:36.955
about what happened, about the

00:09:37.088 --> 00:09:38.323
uprising, about being betrayed

00:09:38.456 --> 00:09:39.090
by Wagner.

